========
commands
========

This sub-machine parses incomming commands.

Legal commands:
0: peer id : 4 ASCII 
NUMERIC bytes
1: peer ble addr type: 1 uint8_t
2: peer ble addr : uint8_t[6]

When the ble addr data and the peer id has been received,
the parent::connect 
event is returned. When the peer id is received
first, the parent::scan event 
is returned.




This machine implements parent machine translator grab_command, translating parent event command.

